  "story": {
    "day": 1,
    "title": "Kaya's Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya woke from her bed on a cold January day.",
      "She took the bus to school, wearing her brown coat.",
      "At her desk, Kaya opened her notebook.",
      "Her teacher wrote with chalk about China and its pandas.",
      "Kaya learned Australia had August summer, not December winter.",
      "\"That is difficult to imagine!\" she thought, touching her ear.",
      "She missed autumn leaves and blue skies.",
      "Later, she drank orange milk, her mouth smiling.",
      "Kaya would soon ride her bike home to practice her guitar in February.",
      "Her long hair blew as she imagined a boat on the sea."
    ]
  }
